@startuml Normal Checkout Flow
!theme plain
title Stripe Payment - Normal Checkout Flow (Success)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Customer as C
participant "PaymentController" as PC
participant "ContractService" as CS
participant "EventDispatcher" as ED
participant "StripeCheckoutSessionHandler" as SCSH
participant "StripeCheckoutReturnHandler" as SCRH
participant "Stripe API" as S
database "Database" as DB

== Phase 1: Initiate Checkout ==

C -> PC: Select Stripe Payment\n(click "Pay Now")
activate PC

PC -> CS: createContract(userId, basket)
activate CS
CS -> DB: Save contract (PENDING)
CS --> PC: PaymentContract
deactivate CS

PC -> ED: dispatch(StripeCheckoutSessionRequestEvent)
activate ED

ED -> SCSH: handle(event)
activate SCSH

SCSH -> SCSH: Build line items\n(products + shipping + fees)
SCSH -> SCSH: Generate contract token

SCSH -> S: checkout.sessions.create({\n  mode: 'payment',\n  line_items: [...],\n  success_url: '...?contract_token=xxx',\n  cancel_url: '...',\n  metadata: { contract_id }\n})
activate S
S --> SCSH: CheckoutSession\n(id: cs_xxx, url: https://checkout.stripe.com/...)
deactivate S

SCSH -> DB: Update contract with session_id
SCSH -> ED: context.set('checkoutUrl', url)
deactivate SCSH

ED --> PC: Event processed
deactivate ED

PC --> C: Redirect to Stripe Checkout
deactivate PC

== Phase 2: Customer on Stripe ==

C -> S: Complete payment on Stripe Checkout
note right of S
  Customer enters card details
  3DS authentication if required
  Payment authorized
end note
S --> C: Redirect to success_url\n(?session_id=cs_xxx&contract_id=xxx&contract_token=xxx)

== Phase 3: Return & Order Creation ==

C -> PC: GET /order?fnc=checkoutSuccess&...
activate PC

PC -> ED: dispatch(StripeCheckoutReturnEvent)
activate ED

ED -> SCRH: handle(event)
activate SCRH

SCRH -> SCRH: Validate contract_token
SCRH -> DB: Load contract by ID
SCRH -> S: checkout.sessions.retrieve(cs_xxx)
activate S
S --> SCRH: Session (payment_status: 'paid')
deactivate S

SCRH -> S: paymentIntents.retrieve(pi_xxx)
activate S
S --> SCRH: PaymentIntent (status: 'succeeded')
deactivate S

SCRH -> SCRH: Satisfy payment condition
SCRH -> SCRH: Check all conditions met

group Contract Fulfillment
  SCRH -> DB: Create OXID Order
  SCRH -> DB: Link order to contract
  SCRH -> DB: Update contract state: FULFILLED
  SCRH -> DB: Clear basket
end

SCRH -> ED: context.set('orderId', oxid)\ncontext.set('orderNumber', 42)
deactivate SCRH

ED --> PC: Event processed
deactivate ED

PC --> C: Redirect to Thank You page
deactivate PC

== Result ==

note over C, DB
  ✅ Order created with order number
  ✅ Contract fulfilled
  ✅ Payment captured in Stripe
  ✅ Customer sees confirmation
end note

@enduml
